    "alltext": "19.\nMAN\nEpudaina appudu appudu Baba\nCHINTHAN BABA\nEpudaina appudu appudu...appudu\nappudu\nMAN\n(ashamed)\nAvunu Baba\nCHINTHAN BABA\nEe Nikrushtamaina ee parikramam\nippude maaneyaali...oka\npancheyyi...ashram store ke velli\nnalabai “dhumapaanam arikatte\npattilu“ konukko..leda yenabai\nteesukunte 20% discount...\nThe devotees start cheering and chanting his name. Meanwhile,\nthe FOREST MINISTER arrives. People start saluting him, as he\nheads right to CHINTHAN BABA. Over the pool, he greets him,\nbends over and touches CHINTHAN BABA’s feet.\nCHINTHAN BABA\nDheergayushmanbhava\nFOREST MINISTER\nLopalaki raa maataddaali\nThe two of them walk along the platform connecting the pool\nto dry land. CHINTHAN BABA spots SULOCHANA in the crowd.\nCHINTHAN BABA\n(to SULOCHANA)\nNee kavalsina valla ki tvaralo\nproblem vosthundi...vachinappudu\nnaa daggariki raa\nFOREST MINISTER\nArey nuvvu rammante vaachestudha\nadhi\nCHINTHAN BABA\nPrati manishiki problem raavatam\nsahajame...ippudu kerchief veysedam\nvalla ae problem vachina naa\ndaggariki vastundi\nHe looks at his disciples. The masses are frenzied again.\nCHINTHAN BABA leaves to a rockstar exit.\nCUT TO:",
